--The customers and product dataset were simply imported into the SQL database. This created the respected tables for it. However, the orders file had to be done manually since thee data (specifically the order_date) was not in the correct format accepted by SQL. The conversion will happen later on.
CREATE TABLE orders ( 
    order_id VARCHAR(10), 
    order_date VARCHAR(20), 
    ship_date DATE, 
    customer_id VARCHAR(10), 
    product_id VARCHAR(10), 
    quantity INT, 
    discount DECIMAL(4,2), 
    sales DECIMAL(10,2), 
    profit DECIMAL(10,2), 
    ship_mode VARCHAR(20) 
    );
